From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dcomp: CompositionGeometricClip and RedirectVisual

ICompositor6::CreateGeometricClip(WithGeometry) make clips to a geometry through a view box, drawn as a Direct2D layer with the geometry as its mask; CreateRedirectVisual(WithSourceVisual) make container visuals that draw their Source's tree again where they are. They were E_NOTIMPL. Identity per windows-rs 0.58.
